              ],
              "S12": [
                "Unit linked and the Swedish premium pension authority (PPM) are included."
              ],
              "S12511": [
                "Ie unit-linked.",
                "Unit linked includes only funds from life insurance companies. The item does not include any other unit linked funds such as  from pension institutions; According to the joint regulations of the EU for National Accounts, some ten life insurance companies have been reclassified from INSEKT sector 1281 (insurance companies) to INSEKT sector 1291 (pension institutions) during 2016."
              ],
              "S1254": [
                "Included in Financial corporations."
              ],
              "S14": [
