                "Individual pension savings, IPS, are included."
              ],
              "S2": [
                "2014K4 there has been a reclassification of SEK 16 billion from the household sector to foreign owners. This affects the market values for 2014K4. The reclassification must be taken in to account when comparing the market value and net savings between 2014K3 and 2014K4."
